# Built packages are withheld from version control until the Videos 6, 7 and
# 8 depth question is resolved.
#
# The packages currently on disk were built from corrected masters that the
# source-integrity audit shows carry about half the previously approved
# spoken script for V6, V7 and V8 (see AUDIT/). Committing them would put a
# compressed V6, V7 and V8 into the repository labeled "regular long-form",
# which is the exact thing the correction exists to prevent. They also
# predate the Video 14 Watch Next normalization.
#
# Everything needed to reproduce them is tracked: build/ holds the complete
# build, and _source/ holds the 18 corrected masters with their checksums.
#
#   cd build && python3 build421.py
#
# Once the V6 to V8 restoration is approved and applied, remove this file and
# commit the rebuilt packages.

